  "body": "![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/2072976/108832303-457fad80-75c3-11eb-8ef5-5161e64e7d3e.png)\r\n\r\nThe logging is fairly light on details:\r\n```\r\n2021-02-23 10:35:27,689 - synapse.server_notices.server_notices_manager - 81 - INFO - GET-137 - Sending server notice to @will:beefy\r\n2021-02-23 10:35:27,706 - synapse.handlers.message - 921 - INFO - GET-139 - Not bothering to persist state event $fAoSuk8bwtNq7-K9MOnZrS7NgZh52-EeWWH6NwjYIS0 duplicated by $WzlsT3cfrTglrbzX0cqRCWh5KvlTYPu0npEgsYn5uQY\r\n2021-02-23 10:35:27,706 - synapse.server_notices.server_notices_manager - 81 - INFO - GET-139 - Sending server notice to @will:beefy\r\n2021-02-23 10:35:27,717 - synapse.server_notices.server_notices_manager - 81 - INFO - GET-137 - Sending server notice to @will:beefy\r\n2021-02-23 10:35:27,736 - synapse.server_notices.server_notices_manager - 81 - INFO - GET-139 - Sending server notice to @will:beefy\r\n```\r\n\r\nI suspect there is a race in the code \r\n",
